# The SDK is committed as parts/ because the whole tarball is 121.5 MB and
# GitHub refuses any blob over 100 MB. reassemble-sdk.sh recreates it locally
# and SDK_SHA256SUMS proves the result; the reassembled file itself must never
# be committed, or the push is rejected outright.
